# Off-Contabo dead-man — user-crontab entry for the Hetzner operator box.
#
# The dead-man MUST run off Contabo (it pages when Contabo itself is dark).
# Install (once, as your normal user — no root needed):
#   ./monitors/install-contabo-deadman.sh
# which appends the line below to your crontab if missing.
#
# Cadence: EVERY 5 MINUTES. Do NOT run this on contabo-a/contabo-b.
# The cron entry points at the STABLE installed copy
# (/usr/local/sbin/contabo-deadman.sh) — never at a worktree path, so pager
# survives worktree retirement. Re-run install-contabo-deadman.sh after
# pulling script updates.

# */5 * * * * /usr/local/sbin/contabo-deadman.sh >> /home/alexey/.local/state/contabo-deadman/cron.log 2>&1
